{"id":"478503","name":"番茄土豆虾皮汤","author":"花擦擦","authorId":"1492203","desc":"","cover":"images/478503/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"土豆","amount":"1只"},{"name":"番茄","amount":"1只"},{"name":"虾皮","amount":"20g"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"味精","amount":"适量"},{"name":"油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"土豆去皮洗净切片，番茄洗净切块，虾皮洗净。","img":"images/478503/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"锅中放水，放入土豆煮","img":"images/478503/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"起油锅加热，放入番茄煸炒炒透取出","img":"images/478503/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"然后放入锅中煮熟","img":"images/478503/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"土豆煮熟后倒入虾皮煮开","img":"images/478503/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入适量的盐煮开","img":"images/478503/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"最后放入适量的味精拌匀即可。","img":"images/478503/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/478503/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}